                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3月29日仙居中学郭连清</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校长携学校</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">班子成员到访</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我校，开启新学期</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">浙江省</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">县中崛起</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">行动中</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">两校合作新篇章。我校领导班子</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">树兰楼</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">会议室</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">接待了来访的仙居中学领导班子，就结对帮扶合作展开深入商谈。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">郭连清对绍兴一中过去一年给予</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">仙居中学</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的大力帮</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">扶</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">表示感谢</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。他</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">详细介绍了仙居中学</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">过去一年所</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">取得的成绩</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">：</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">通过两校</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">结对帮扶的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">共同努力，仙居中学在教学质量、学生综合素质、教育科研等方面都有了显著提升。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">党委书记、校长王琛对仙居中学取得的成绩表示热烈祝贺，并对过去一年的帮扶工作进行了回顾和总结。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">他</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">指出，此次</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">仙居中学领导班子来访</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">交流是</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">两校结对</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">签约一周年的重要活动，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">将开启</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">两校合作</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">新阶段。他表示，绍兴一中将继续秉承合作共赢的原则，与仙居中学共同探索教育教学改革，为提升两校的教育教学质量而</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">持续</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">努力。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">他</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">强调，通过一年</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">来</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的结对帮扶</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">工作</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我校</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教师团队也在交流互动中得到了成长和提升</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，希望</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">两校教师继续加强交流，共享优质教育资源，共同推动教育教学工作再上新台阶。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2023年3月，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">根据《浙江省山区26县和海岛“县中崛起”行动计划》以及省政府2023年“十方面民生实事”的工作要求，我校与仙居中学举行了签约仪式，建立了结对帮扶关系。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在过去的一年中，两校在教育教学、管理经验、资源共享等方面进行了广泛而深入的交流与合作。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在双方的互学互鉴中，我们坚信两校将携手并进、共同发展，创造更加辉煌的成绩。通过与仙居中学等兄弟学校的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">深度</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">交流与紧密合作，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我校将进一步发挥示范引领作用，为推动地区教育均衡发展和提升教育现代化水平做出新的更大贡献。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2024\4\202404011529149692.Jpeg" style="width: 5.745833in; height: 4.309028in" alt="202404011529142351.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2024\4\202404011529142716.Jpeg" style="width: 5.7375in; height: 2.795139in" alt="202404011529140476.Jpeg" /></span></p>
    
